msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chaaan......?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Ryuu-chaaan......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, yeah. Morning, Yasuko.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí. Buenos días, Yasuko.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Whatcha doin' with all those chopped＿radishes?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Qué haces con todos esos＿rábanos picados?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yup...... It's quiet, after allll.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Sip...... Después de todo,＿hay mucho silenciooo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What the? Isn't that a good thing? Go＿back to sleep.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y qué? ¿No es algo bueno?＿Vuelve a dormir.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Hey Ryuu-chan, where's＿Taiga-channn?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Oye, Ryuu-chan, ¿dónde＿está Taiga-channn?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Yasuko「Buuut...... It's been three days since she＿last came for food, you know?＿Ryuu-chan, aren't you lonelyyy?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Perooo...... Ya pasaron tres días desde＿la última vez que vino a comer, ¿sabes?＿Ryuu-chan, ¿no te sientes solooo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This......? This is nothing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Esto......? Esto no es nada.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Hm～? It's not not nothing.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Mm～? No es que no sea nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Enough, now go back to sleep already.＿Don't worry about Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya basta, vuelve a dormir de una＿vez. No te preocupes por Taiga.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh? Can Ryuu-chan be trusted?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Ah? ¿Se puede confiar en Ryuu-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. Tonight she'll be over for dinner,＿and everything will be back to normal.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Esta noche vendrá a cenar, y＿todo volverá a la normalidad.」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Got it～ Be sure to make lots of＿Taiga-chan's favorite foods tonight,＿Ryuu-chan♪」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......Entendido～ Asegúrate de preparar＿muchos de los platos favoritos de＿Taiga-chan esta noche, Ryuu-chan♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......I need to talk to her face to face.＿Thinking by myself doesn't solve＿anything.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Tengo que hablar con＿ella cara a cara. Pensar yo＿solo no resuelve nada.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（When Kitamura said he could＿understand Taiga better, why did I get＿so pissed off......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Cuando Kitamura dijo que él podía＿entender mejor a Taiga, ¿por qué＿me molesté tanto......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What was Taiga thinking, trying to＿support Kitamura's one-sided＿feelings......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué estaba pensando Taiga al tratar＿de apoyar los sentimientos no＿correspondidos de Kitamura......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Taiga......）」"

msgid "Yuri「......*Sigh*...... Well, whatever.＿Kitamura-kun, if you would.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......*Suspiro*...... Bueno, como＿sea. Kitamura-kun, adelante.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Let's give this semester our all!＿Everyone, stand! Bow!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Demos lo mejor este semestre!＿¡Todos, de pie! ¡Saluden!」"

msgid "Haruta「Awoooo! The Master's commands are＿electrifying～!!」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡Auuuu! ¡¡Las órdenes del Maestro＿son electrizantes～!!」"

msgid "Yuri「Good grief......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Qué barbaridad......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Alright, now......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Muy bien, ahora......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Taiga!」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「H-Hey! Don't ignore me! I went to the＿trouble of......! Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡O-Oye! ¡No me ignores! ¡Me tomé＿la molestia de......! ¡Taiga!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Fuck, she left......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Mierda, se fue......）」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, it's Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, es Kushieda.」"

msgid "Minori「Oho, openly disheartened, are we?＿Mayhaps be you not satisfied with＿Kushieda, good sir?」"
msgstr "Minori「Oh, ¿tan abiertamente desanimado?＿¿Acaso no os satisface la presencia＿de Kushieda, buen caballero?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not really dissatisfied or anything.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tampoco es que esté insatisfecho.」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Minori「Nothing. I was just wondering how your＿memory's doing.」"
msgstr "Minori「Nada. Solo me preguntaba＿cómo va tu memoria.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just so-so. I've remembered about＿Kitamura, and Kanou-senpai...... and＿Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Más o menos. Ya me acordé de Kitamura,＿de Kanou-senpai...... y de Taiga.」"

msgid "Minori「That so......? I see.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿En serio......? Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That's all you have to say?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eso es todo lo que vas a decir?」"

msgid "Minori「Did something happen between you＿and Taiga? That girl's clearly acting＿weird, right?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Pasó algo entre tú y Taiga? Es evidente＿que esa chica actúa raro, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I have something to ask the＿All-Knowing Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, tengo algo que preguntarle＿a la omnisciente Kushieda.」"

msgid "Minori「Very well.」"
msgstr "Minori「Adelante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga likes Kitamura, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A Taiga le gusta Kitamura, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Am I wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Me equivoco?」"

msgid "Minori「That thing in your hands is a lunch＿box, right? For Taiga?」"
msgstr "Minori「Eso que tienes en las manos es una caja＿de almuerzo, ¿no? ¿Para Taiga?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, yeah. She hasn't been eating at my＿house lately.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, sí. Últimamente no ha estado＿comiendo en mi casa.」"

msgid "Minori「Gotcha. That's pretty serious, then.」"
msgstr "Minori「Entiendo. Entonces es bastante serio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. I thought I'd be able to have a＿talk with her, but......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Pensé que podría hablar un＿poco con ella, pero......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why? Because if she doesn't balance＿her diet with something healthy now＿and then, she'll get pimples and stuff.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué? Porque si no equilibra su＿dieta con algo sano de vez en cuando,＿le van a salir granos y esas cosas.」"

msgid "Minori「That's all?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eso es todo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「You know the real reason, don't you?」"
msgstr "Minori「Tú sabes el verdadero motivo, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「Whatevers. Now's not the time to make＿jokes. Welp, this girl's gotta get to＿practice!」"
msgstr "Minori「Como sea. No es momento para hacer＿bromas. ¡Bueno, esta chica se＿va al entrenamiento!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Right after the opening ceremony?＿Damn, girl.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Justo después de la ceremonia＿de apertura? Caray contigo.」"

msgid "Minori「No biggie. The real problem is＿complacency, dude. Laters～!」"
msgstr "Minori「No pasa nada. El verdadero problema es＿el conformismo, amigo. ¡Nos vemos～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Damn it Kushieda, you didn't answer＿my question......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Maldita sea, Kushieda, no respondiste＿mi pregunta......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh......? *Gasp*!! Well, half of this is for＿miso soup, and the other half...... for＿tonight's stew? Yeah, for dinner.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh......? ¡¡Ah!! Bueno, la mitad es＿para sopa de miso, y el resto......＿¿para el guiso de hoy? Sí, para la cena.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yasuko, you're early today.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yasuko, hoy madrugaste.」"

msgid "Yasuko「When Yacchan doesn't hear＿Taiga-chan's voice at this time of day,＿Yacchan feels all weirddd, or like, the」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Cuando Yacchan no escucha la voz de＿Taiga-chan a esta hora, Yacchan se＿siente muy raraaa, o como que el」"

msgid "Yasuko「internal block gets messed uppp......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「meloj interno se descomponeee......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Internal CLOCK. Taiga doesn't have to＿eat at our house every day, right?＿Maybe she misses convenience store」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「RELOJ interno. Taiga no tiene que comer＿aquí a diario, ¿no? Quizá lo que extrañe＿de la tienda de conveniencia sea」"

msgid "Ryuuji「food.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「la comida.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Maybe Taiga-chan doesn't like＿Ryuu-chan and Yacchan anymoreee?＿When Taiga-chan's not around,」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Será que a Taiga-chan ya no le＿caen bien Ryuu-chan ni Yacchaaan?＿Cuando Taiga-chan no está,」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan feels, feels lonely...... Waaah～!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan se siente, se siente＿sola...... ¡Buaaa～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「At your age, you shouldn't cry over＿that stuff...... Today's the opening＿ceremony, so I'll see her at school」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A tu edad no deberías llorar por＿eso...... Hoy es la ceremonia de＿apertura, así que la veré en la escuela」"

msgid "Ryuuji「anyway.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「de todos modos.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh yeah, today's the opening＿ceremonyyy. Come straight home～!＿But...... why are you making a boxed」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ah, hoy es la ceremonia de aperturaaa.＿¡Vuelve directo a casa～! Pero...... ¿por＿qué preparas una caja de」"

msgid "Yasuko「lunch then?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「almuerzo entonces?」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, this concludes homeroom for＿today. Everyone, you can't stay in the＿winter break mood forever, you know?」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, con esto termina la tutoría de＿hoy. No pueden seguir en modo vacaciones＿de invierno siempre, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Yuri「You'll be third-years soon, so......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Pronto pasarán a tercer＿año, así que......」"

msgid "Haruta「YAY～ It's been a while since we all＿went to karaoke. KA-RA-O-KE! These＿fugly old uniforms really look great on」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡YUPIII～! Hacía tiempo que no íbamos al＿karaoke. ¡KA-RA-O-KE! Estos feos＿uniformes viejos les quedan genial a」"

msgid "Haruta「everyone～ So lovely!」"
msgstr "Haruta「todos～ ¡Qué encanto!」"

msgid "Minori「Bulls-eye. I, Minorin, can read Taiga's＿mind perfectly. But as you might＿expect, I can't predict the color of her」"
msgstr "Minori「En el blanco. Yo, Minorin, puedo leer＿la mente de Taiga a la perfección. Pero＿claro, no puedo predecir el color」"

msgid "Minori「underwear or anything, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「de su ropa interior ni nada, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Minori「Rather than who Taiga likes, maybe＿you should think about the feelings＿behind why you want to give her that」"
msgstr "Minori「En vez de pensar en quién le gusta a＿Taiga, quizá deberías pensar en los＿sentimientos detrás de querer darle esa」"

msgid "Minori「boxed lunch, hm?」"
msgstr "Minori「caja de almuerzo, ¿no?」"
